# Generated code — kept in the tree and CI-checked with `make generate` +
# `git diff --exit-code`. Collapsed in review by default, but still diffable:
# `make generate` strips goa's seeded OpenAPI examples (see the
# strip-openapi-examples target), which were ~97% of those artifacts and
# re-expanded across the whole document whenever a referenced type changed.
# Without that step the specs had to be marked `-diff`, which hid genuine API
# surface changes from review along with the noise.
api/gen/** linguist-generated=true
frontend/src/api/schema.gen.ts linguist-generated=true
